==Description==
'''Stay Cool''' is a sticker obtained from Sergeant II rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases the default Level 4 [[Freezer]] crying while pointing with two hands. It plays a sound of water droplets falling into a puddle.

==Update History==
*'''23 July 2025''' - [[v1.71.0]]
**'''Stay Cool''' added.
**{{Bug}} Does not play its sound when used.
*'''24 July 2025''' - [[v1.71.0|v1.71.4a]]
**{{Bugfix}} Now plays its sound.
*'''22 October 2025''' - [[v1.77.0|v1.77.5a]]
**'''Stay Cool''' is no longer obtainable.



